{"id": "33906", "title": "纵情贝勒(京城四美男4)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33906.htm", "intro": "女扮男装上酒楼寻她亲亲胤祺哥哥，可人没寻着，却……目睹一个不知羞的男人裸身在她面前晃荡，回家后，想尽办法将他忘掉却无法如愿，而亲亲胤祺哥哥不帮她排除烦恼就算了，还火上加油的要弃她前往江南，这怎么可以，江南可是美女如云耶，她得想法子跟去不可，可……才一眨眼工夫，事情却全走了样，她不但误上了那不知羞男人的“贼船”，为了吃穿，她还得当他的ㄚ鬟服侍他，啊！她这皇上最宠爱的九格格是不是太命苦……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33906", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2156008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2156009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2156010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2156011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2156012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2156013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2156014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2156015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2156016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2156017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2156018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2156019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2156020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2156021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2156022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2156023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2156024.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2156025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2156026.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2156027.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2156028.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2156029.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2156030.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2156031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2156032.html", "available": fa